<createdBy>stb</createdBy>
<createdTime>2020-02-03 20:18:16 UTC</createdTime>
<comment><![CDATA[Arcs bundle relationships emerging from one entity together. Only one of the relationships set at a given timepoint.

All relationships in a ARC have to be of the same MAPTYPE and have the same MANDATORY-value at the end of the entity the ARC is defined for.

Subtype of MODELELEMENT. ARCS_ID is always identical to the corresponding MODE_ID]]></comment>
